WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.980
- So, Charlize and Kerry, the two of you,

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:04.920
you're an elite group
of women in Hollywood,

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:07.659
like, people love you,
love everything you do.

00:00:07.659 --> 00:00:08.492
(audience cheers)

00:00:08.492 --> 00:00:11.100
And you do such huge
films, the both of you.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.260
We know you like so well. TV, everything.

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:16.770
So, what made you gravitate
towards this project?

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:20.220
- Well, I am a single
mom to two little girls.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:25.220
Seven and ten. And my repertoire's
quite dark. (laughter)

00:00:25.627 --> 00:00:26.790
- [Kelly] "Monster"? What? (laughs)

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:27.960
- Yeah. Yeah.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:28.830
- They didn't like that?

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:30.330
- I have a feeling they'd have to be

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:33.690
at least 52 to see any
of my work. (laughter)

00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:34.830
So there's a lot of mystery.

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:38.010
There's like, "Why do we see Mom on a set,

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:39.900
and she's always covered in blood?"

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:42.360
So this felt like I could do something

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:44.460
that's a little bit of a love
letter to them, you know?

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:45.293
And -
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:45.293 --> 00:00:49.080
- They saw it with me in
Rome, a couple of weeks ago.

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:52.170
Oh my God. Like, you know,
I'm gonna be 50 soon.

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:57.010
And I was like, I thought I
was jaded and dead inside.

00:00:57.010 --> 00:01:00.630
Like I wanted their approval so badly.

00:01:00.630 --> 00:01:02.580
It was almost, I had to re-watch the movie

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:03.720
'cause I'd barely watched it.

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:05.430
I was just watching their faces.

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:07.020
- Yeah, their reaction. Yeah.

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:09.540
- Yeah. So I really
wanted to do something.

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:13.440
I also, I really love Paul.
I had worked with Paul.

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:15.810
I was lucky enough to work
with Paul a couple years ago.

00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:18.120
And had such a great experience with him.

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:18.953
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:18.953 --> 00:01:21.600
- And then this cast and
the story, was really,

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:23.820
it was a big world, and fun,

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:27.810
and we were all coming out of lockdown.

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:30.750
So I think we were just,
this felt like such a gift.

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:34.380
To be able to go and
play in these costumes,

00:01:34.380 --> 00:01:35.910
coming out of COVID.

00:01:35.910 --> 00:01:37.980
- Yeah. It's so cool. It is funny.

00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:39.360
'Cause I have two kids,
too. I'm a single mom too.

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:41.382
And it is funny. All that you do,

00:01:41.382 --> 00:01:43.738
it's so funny what counts to them.

00:01:43.738 --> 00:01:44.571
- Yeah.
- Yes.

00:01:44.571 --> 00:01:45.404
- Like, you're like, wait,

00:01:45.404 --> 00:01:47.400
I've done like some really cool stuff.

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:48.593
- [Charlize] Most of it,
they don't care about.

00:01:48.593 --> 00:01:51.597
- They don't care. I know
they're impressed by the -

00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:53.910
But of course they're impressed by this.

00:01:53.910 --> 00:01:56.460
And what cool thing to be
a part of, like a series.

